# Everything below is GENERATED by running this project. None of it belongs in
# git — it is either large, machine-specific, or a snapshot of a site that will
# have changed by the time anyone reads it. The repo carried ~1.7 MB of exactly
# this before the first push: three sets of scrape output from August 12, a
# 438 KB screenshot, a 198 KB page capture and a build-report PDF.

# --- scrape output -------------------------------------------------------
*.json
*.csv
!package.json
# Committed on purpose: a real 3-row excerpt of a real run, so a reader can see
# the exact output shape without installing anything.
!sample_output.json
!sample_output.csv
farfetch_products.*
t4b_sel_local.*
test_farfetch*.*

# --- the live-test harness's working directory ---------------------------
live_results/
live_results.zip

# --- debug artifacts the diagnostics drop next to themselves -------------
# check_signup_captcha*.py write these on purpose, for manual inspection.
signup_modal_debug*.html
signup_modal_debug*.png
account_icon_search*.png
*_debug.html
*_debug.png

# --- caches --------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.fingerprint_cache/

# --- environments --------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- editors / OS --------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# --- never, under any circumstances --------------------------------------
# The scrapers mask user:pass in their own logs, but raw HTML dumps and the
# Scraper API's x-debug header are NOT masked, and a key pasted into a shell
# history file is not masked either.
*.log
.env
*.key
secrets*
